{"is_source_file": true, "format": "C", "description": "This file implements a Linux kernel module for splitting firmware images for BCM63XX hardware. It contains functions to read image tags, parse partition layouts, and register a partition parser for MTD devices. The code interacts with flash memory, performs CRC checks, and manages partition information specific to BCM63XX.\n\nKey functionalities include reading image tags, parsing partition details based on metadata, and integrating with the Linux MTD subsystem as a module.", "external_files": ["<linux/bcm963xx_tag.h>", "<linux/crc32.h>", "<linux/init.h>", "<linux/kernel.h>", "<linux/module.h>", "<linux/slab.h>", "<linux/byteorder/generic.h>", "<linux/mtd/mtd.h>", "<linux/mtd/partitions.h>", "mtdsplit.h"], "external_methods": ["mtd_read", "crc32_le", "kstrtouint", "mtdpart_get_offset", "mtd_check_rootfs_magic", "register_mtd_parser"], "published": ["mtdsplit_bcm63xx_parser"], "classes": [], "methods": [{"name": "int bcm63xx_read_image_tag(struct mtd_info * master,loff_t offset,struct bcm_tag * hdr)", "description": "Reads and verifies the image tag from flash memory at a specified offset, performs CRC check, and logs relevant information if valid.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "int bcm63xx_parse_partitions(struct mtd_info * master,const struct mtd_partition ** pparts,struct bcm_tag * hdr)", "description": "Parses partition layout from the image tag, determines offsets and sizes of kernel and root filesystem partitions, and allocates partition structures.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "int mtdsplit_parse_bcm63xx(struct mtd_info * master,const struct mtd_partition ** pparts,struct mtd_part_parser_data * data)", "description": "Main parsing function that scans flash memory for an image tag and delegates partition parsing.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "int __init mtdsplit_bcm63xx_init(void)", "description": "Initializes and registers the BCM63XX firmware parser module.", "scope"